	<!--
		Hand Cannon, main hand (left click): the pistol's attack at half the rate, its rounds 1.5
		times a pistol round (hcannon_round*.unit, mul 1.2 to the pistol's 0.8). Alone, one
		round every 600 ms. With an off-hand Hand Cannon, one from each muzzle in turn (a
		1200 ms cycle). With an off-hand pistol, pistol, cannon, pistol 100 ms apart, then the
		lone pistol's 300 ms (a 500 ms cycle); the main-hand pistol runs the same burst with an
		off-hand cannon (hwp_attack_glock mix1-3).
